    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i> </p><p>A Surveillance Detector is a small, handheld device that scans an area for eavesdropping devices and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surveillance_Tagger\" title=\"Surveillance Tagger\">Surveillance Taggers</a>. When activated, the Surveillance Detector grants a +10 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks for locating active or passive <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surveillance_Devices\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surveillance Devices\">Surveillance Devices</a> within 6 squares of the detector. It can be set to either display the presence of eavesdropping or to emit an alarm when such attempts are detected. </p>",
